SOURCE DOCUMENT B — DESIGNED SILVER JUBILEE MAGAZINE (PDF)

"Rang-The-9-Colours-Digital.pdf"

This is the MASTER DESIGN REFERENCE.

Study its front cover, back cover, internal page designs, photographic treatments, decorative details, typography, borders, mountain illustrations, colours and editorial compositions.

Use it as the visual design system for the website.

Absolute content and design hierarchy

1. The Word document determines what the website says.
2. The PDF determines how the website looks.
3. Original photographs and logos are to be used wherever available.
4. Do not confuse the visual reference PDF with the authoritative text source.
5. Where the documents disagree, prioritise the Word document and flag the discrepancy for editorial verification.

Do not create an ordinary NGO website using generic templates. Do not reduce the magazine into a few generic summaries.

The objective is to transform the magazine into a comprehensive, searchable, interactive digital publication and institutional website.

